@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Importar Alfa
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/imports/alfa
Content-Type: application/json

< ../samples/alfa/purchase-orders.json

### Importar Beta
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/imports/beta
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=V360Boundary

--V360Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="headersFile"; filename="cabecalho.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../samples/beta/cabecalho.csv
--V360Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="itemsFile"; filename="itens.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../samples/beta/itens.csv
--V360Boundary--

### Importar Gama
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/imports/gama
Content-Type: application/json

< ../samples/gama/purchase-orders.json

### Listar pedidos com saldo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/purchase-orders?pendingOnly=true&page=0&size=20

### Detalhar pedido Gama normalizado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/purchase-orders/GAMA/GL-778

### Conferência aprovada do Alfa
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/purchase-orders/ALFA/4500001234/invoice-validations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorTaxId": "23456789000101",
  "items": [
    {
      "materialCode": "MAT-1001",
      "quantity": 40,
      "totalAmount": 1836.00
    }
  ]
}

### Conferência com múltiplas divergências
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/purchase-orders/ALFA/4500001234/invoice-validations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorTaxId": "11111111000111",
  "items": [
    {
      "materialCode": "MAT-1001",
      "quantity": 50,
      "totalAmount": 1.00
    }
  ]
}

### Relatório geral
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/invoice-validations

